#. type: TH
#: debian-bookworm mageia-cauldron
#, no-wrap
msgid "ioctl_fslabel"
msgstr "ioctl_fslabel"

#. type: TH
#: debian-bookworm
#, no-wrap
msgid "2023-02-05"
msgstr "5 февраля 2023 г."

#. type: TH
#: debian-bookworm
#, no-wrap
msgid "Linux man-pages 6.03"
msgstr "Справочные страницы Linux 6.03"

#. type: SH
#: debian-bookworm mageia-cauldron
#, no-wrap
msgid "NAME"
msgstr "НАИМЕНОВАНИЕ"

#. type: Plain text
#: debian-bookworm mageia-cauldron
msgid "ioctl_fslabel - get or set a filesystem label"
msgstr ""

#. type: SH
#: debian-bookworm mageia-cauldron
#, no-wrap
msgid "LIBRARY"
msgstr "БИБЛИОТЕКА"

#. type: Plain text
#: debian-bookworm mageia-cauldron
msgid "Standard C library (I<libc>, I<-lc>)"
msgstr "Стандартная библиотека языка C (I<libc>, I<-lc>)"

#. type: SH
#: debian-bookworm mageia-cauldron
#, no-wrap
msgid "SYNOPSIS"
msgstr "ОБЗОР"

#. type: Plain text
#: debian-bookworm mageia-cauldron
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"B<#include E<lt>linux/fs.hE<gt>>       /* Definition of B<*FSLABEL*> constants */\n"
"B<#include E<lt>sys/ioctl.hE<gt>>\n"
msgstr ""
"B<#include E<lt>linux/fs.hE<gt>>       /* определения констант B<*FSLABEL*> */\n"
"B<#include E<lt>sys/ioctl.hE<gt>>\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: debian-bookworm mageia-cauldron
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"B<int ioctl(int >I<fd>B<, FS_IOC_GETFSLABEL, char >I<label>B<[FSLABEL_MAX]);>\n"
"B<int ioctl(int >I<fd>B<, FS_IOC_SETFSLABEL, char >I<label>B<[FSLABEL_MAX]);>\n"
msgstr ""
"B<int ioctl(int >I<fd>B<, FS_IOC_GETFSLABEL, char >I<label>B<[FSLABEL_MAX]);>\n"
"B<int ioctl(int >I<fd>B<, FS_IOC_SETFSLABEL, char >I<label>B<[FSLABEL_MAX]);>\n"

#. type: SH
#: debian-bookworm mageia-cauldron
#, no-wrap
msgid "DESCRIPTION"
msgstr "ОПИСАНИЕ"

#. type: Plain text
#: debian-bookworm mageia-cauldron
msgid ""
"If a filesystem supports online label manipulation, these B<ioctl>(2)  "
"operations can be used to get or set the filesystem label for the filesystem "
"on which I<fd> resides.  The B<FS_IOC_SETFSLABEL> operation requires "
"privilege (B<CAP_SYS_ADMIN>)."
msgstr ""

#. type: SH
#: debian-bookworm mageia-cauldron
#, no-wrap
msgid "RETURN VALUE"
msgstr "ВОЗВРАЩАЕМОЕ ЗНАЧЕНИЕ"

#. type: Plain text
#: debian-bookworm mageia-cauldron
#, fuzzy
#| msgid ""
#| "On success, B<ioprio_set>()  returns 0.  On error, -1 is returned, and "
#| "I<errno> is set to indicate the error."
msgid ""
"On success zero is returned.  On error, -1 is returned, and I<errno> is set "
"to indicate the error."
msgstr ""
"При успешном выполнении B<ioprio_set>() возвращается 0. При ошибке "
"возвращается -1, а в I<errno> содержится код ошибки."

#. type: SH
#: debian-bookworm mageia-cauldron
#, no-wrap
msgid "ERRORS"
msgstr "ОШИБКИ"

#. type: Plain text
#: debian-bookworm mageia-cauldron
msgid "Possible errors include (but are not limited to) the following:"
msgstr "Возможные ошибки включают (но не ограничиваются) следующее:"

#. type: TP
#: debian-bookworm mageia-cauldron
#, no-wrap
msgid "B<EFAULT>"
msgstr "B<EFAULT>"

#. type: Plain text
#: debian-bookworm mageia-cauldron
msgid "I<label> references an inaccessible memory area."
msgstr "I<label> ссылается на недоступную область памяти."

#. type: TP
#: debian-bookworm mageia-cauldron
#, no-wrap
msgid "B<EINVAL>"
msgstr "B<EINVAL>"

#. type: Plain text
#: debian-bookworm mageia-cauldron
msgid ""
"The specified label exceeds the maximum label length for the filesystem."
msgstr ""

#. type: TP
#: debian-bookworm mageia-cauldron
#, no-wrap
msgid "B<ENOTTY>"
msgstr "B<ENOTTY>"

#. type: Plain text
#: debian-bookworm mageia-cauldron
#, fuzzy
#| msgid "The filesystem does not support this call."
msgid ""
"This can appear if the filesystem does not support online label manipulation."
msgstr "Файловая система не поддерживает данный вызов."

#. type: TP
#: debian-bookworm mageia-cauldron
#, no-wrap
msgid "B<EPERM>"
msgstr "B<EPERM>"

#. type: Plain text
#: debian-bookworm mageia-cauldron
#, fuzzy
#| msgid "The calling thread has insufficient privilege."
msgid ""
"The calling process does not have sufficient permissions to set the label."
msgstr "Вызывающая нить не имеет достаточно прав."

#. type: SH
#: debian-bookworm
#, no-wrap
msgid "VERSIONS"
msgstr "ВЕРСИИ"

#. type: Plain text
#: debian-bookworm
#, fuzzy
#| msgid ""
#| "These ioctl operations first appeared in Linux 4.5.  They were previously "
#| "known as B<BTRFS_IOC_CLONE> and B<BTRFS_IOC_CLONE_RANGE>, and were "
#| "private to Btrfs."
msgid ""
"These B<ioctl>(2)  operations first appeared in Linux 4.18.  They were "
"previously known as B<BTRFS_IOC_GET_FSLABEL> and B<BTRFS_IOC_SET_FSLABEL> "
"and were private to Btrfs."
msgstr ""
"Данные операции ioctl появились в Linux 4.5. Раньше они назывались "
"B<BTRFS_IOC_CLONE> и B<BTRFS_IOC_CLONE_RANGE> и работали только в Btrfs."

#. type: SH
#: debian-bookworm mageia-cauldron
#, no-wrap
msgid "STANDARDS"
msgstr "СТАНДАРТЫ"

#. type: Plain text
#: debian-bookworm
msgid "This API is Linux-specific."
msgstr "Данный программный интерфейс существует только в Linux."

#. type: SH
#: debian-bookworm mageia-cauldron
#, no-wrap
msgid "NOTES"
msgstr "ПРИМЕЧАНИЯ"

#. type: Plain text
#: debian-bookworm mageia-cauldron
msgid ""
"The maximum string length for this interface is B<FSLABEL_MAX>, including "
"the terminating null byte (\\[aq]\\e0\\[aq]).  Filesystems have differing "
"maximum label lengths, which may or may not include the terminating null.  "
"The string provided to B<FS_IOC_SETFSLABEL> must always be null-terminated, "
"and the string returned by B<FS_IOC_GETFSLABEL> will always be null-"
"terminated."
msgstr ""

#. type: SH
#: debian-bookworm mageia-cauldron
#, no-wrap
msgid "SEE ALSO"
msgstr "СМОТРИТЕ ТАКЖЕ"

#. type: Plain text
#: debian-bookworm mageia-cauldron
msgid "B<ioctl>(2), B<blkid>(8)"
msgstr "B<ioctl>(2), B<blkid>(8)"

#. type: TH
#: mageia-cauldron
#, no-wrap
msgid "2023-10-31"
msgstr "31 октября 2023 г."

